WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:03.921
- I bless our new leader,
Catherine the Great.

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:05.172
[dramatic string music]

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:07.174
- You're calling yourself
"the Great"?

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:09.134
- Of course.
- Seems arrogant.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.553
- It is if you're not great.
If you are,

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:14.139
they're just calling things
what they are.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.807
- Right.
- Shh.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:20.479
- Darling girl, there is
a rumor sweeping Europe

00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:23.106
that you have taken Russia
from your husband.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:25.150
- You're my wife.
You honestly can't think

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.693
you can run Russia
without bloodshed?

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.986
- I can.
I'm winning.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.488
- I love that you think that.

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:30.614
ORLO: He's a threat.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:31.907
I really, really want
to kill him.

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:33.283
- Reason and compassion can win

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.868
any argument
better than violence.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.913
- Let's just behead him
like civilized men.

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:40.123
CATHERINE: We must act.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.875
Let us remake Russia,
my friend.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.919
- Everyone expects you
to only last a year.

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:46.129
- I am safe
until the baby is born.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.340
- It must be strange,
a human creature inside you.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.093
Do you ever think,
"What if he has a knife?"

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.761
- I never do.
- Hmm.

00:00:54.805 --> 00:00:56.974
ELIZABETH: This is a dynasty.
If she loves you,

00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:59.560
you'll make more babies
and protect the family line.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.478
You must make her love you.

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:02.479
- Should we have sex?

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:03.647
- I'd rather choke to death

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:05.941
on this tiny chicken.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:07.776
- I have been trying
to change myself.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.695
- When you are flawless!
- Exactly.

00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:12.322
It's time I regain the throne.
- And then you kill her.

00:01:12.322 --> 00:01:13.949
- Imprisoned
until Paul is born.

00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:15.784
- You're a good dad.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:19.997
PETER: You're not long
for the throne.

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:22.541
I'm chosen by God.
You were chosen by mail order.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:23.876
Ponder that.

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:25.127
CATHERINE: I had a busy day
running Russia,

00:01:25.127 --> 00:01:28.130
the country
I just took from you.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.506
Go get him!

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:34.219
[gasps]

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:35.387
- Are you kidding?

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:36.847
That could have been me!

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:40.934
She loves me, that is certain.
- You sure?

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.937
- I look at you
and go dry like sand.

